ass=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_EPI_Letter_IsobelNightsong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_EPI_Letter_IsobelNightsong\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">5c47e3d7-1246-4f26-a9b5-d56670fb5afc</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:5c47e3d7-1246-4f26-a9b5-d56670fb5afc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:5c47e3d7-1246-4f26-a9b5-d56670fb5afc\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Within the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chest_of_Grateful_Words\" title=\"Chest of Grateful Words\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/20px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/40px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/20px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Chest_of_Grateful_Words\" title=\"Chest of Grateful Words\">Chest of Grateful Words</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Our dear friend,\n</p><p><br>\nYou might have heard by now of the strange attacks on <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\">Selûnite</a> enclaves across the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Sword_Coast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sword Coast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Sword_Coast\">Sword Coast</a></span>. Aylin and I have been investigating tirelessly, but we can find no pattern, no cause. <a href=\"/wiki/Aylin\" title=\"Aylin\">Aylin</a> is beside herself with fury, and I'm not far behind her. I know we'll find the culprit, though I sometimes wish you were joined to our cause. But you've done your part for the realms. Now it's time we do ours.\n</p><p><br>\nApart from this dreadful matter, we are well. After all we've faced, whatever life may offer is most welcome. Aylin sends her regards - most heartily, as I'm sure you can imagine.\n</p><p><br>\nWe both hope to see you again some day. All our very best,\n</p><p><br>\nIsobel Thorm\n</p><p><br>\nP.S. IT IS I, DAME AYLIN! I SEND MY REGARDS!\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Contingent on Isobel and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aylin\" title=\"Aylin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Aylin.png/25px-Portrait_Aylin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Aylin.png/38px-Portrait_Aylin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Aylin.png/50px-Portrait_Aylin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aylin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Aylin.png/25px-Portrait_Aylin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Portrait_Aylin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aylin\" title=\"Aylin\">Aylin</a> surviving <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a></li>\n<li>This letter is currently (Patch #8, Hotfix #34) not obtainable, because for it to be sent, it is checked if the flag <code>SCE_Isobel_State_WillJoinCamp_bd91b63d-9c38-1399-cb7d-9eeddff8b039</code> is set true, but it is never set.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714211722\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.082 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.086 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2442/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 41721/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12681/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1603/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua tim